# Linux运行库只允许由Release候选从产品源码外产物目录注入；
# 源码树永远不能保存 Core/Host ELF、CMake cache 或安装投影。
/linux/lib/
/linux/.cache/
/linux/CMakeCache.txt
/linux/CMakeFiles/
/linux/cmake_install.cmake
# Windows 运行件只在中央候选中注入；源码树不得保存 DLL/LIB/CMake/MSVC 状态。
/windows/bin/
/windows/lib/
/windows/.vs/
/windows/CMakeCache.txt
/windows/CMakeFiles/
/windows/cmake_install.cmake
/windows/**/*.dll
/windows/**/*.lib
/windows/**/*.obj
/windows/**/*.pdb
*.xcresult
*.dSYM
*.log
*.tmp
*.swp
.DS_Store

/target
.claude/

target/
*.sst

# Local chain state

# Frontend build artifacts

# Python cache
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Local/generated backup files
*.spec*-backup

# OS / Editor junk
**/.DS_Store

# IDE local settings
.vscode/
.idea/

# JS/TS local artifacts
**/node_modules/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Dart / Flutter generated files
**/.dart_tool/
**/.packages
**/.flutter-plugins
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/.pub/
**/build/
**/coverage/

# Flutter iOS generated dependencies
**/ios/Pods/
**/ios/.symlinks/
**/ios/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/ios/Flutter/Generated.xcconfig
**/ios/Flutter/flutter_export_environment.sh
**/ios/Flutter/Flutter.podspec

# Flutter Android local/generated files
**/android/.gradle/
**/android/local.properties

# Android 系统错误报告可能包含设备与网络诊断信息，禁止进入仓库。
/bugreport-*.zip

# Android signing secrets

# 注册局前端构建产物

# Flutter IDE user state
**/ios/Runner.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
**/ios/Runner.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/

# CitizenApp native generated artifacts
**/android/.kotlin/

# 本机 AI 入口直接解析唯一规则；产品源码不跟踪本机链接。
/CODEX.md
/CLAUDE.md
